      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The diagnosis of \"CF asthma\" is problematic and it is difficult to determine which patients have a combination of CF and asthma and which have asthma like symptoms caused by inflammation of the CF lung. This may not matter, however; the relevance lies in the possible approaches to treatment."},
